    "name": "Atom-safe ramp loss",
    "construction": "\\(H_{b,h}(z)=0\\) for \\(|z|\\le b\\), \\(H_{b,h}(z)=(|z|-b)/h\\) for \\(b<|z|<b+h\\), and \\(H_{b,h}(z)=1\\) for \\(|z|\\ge b+h\\).",
